@guide H_Stranglethorn
@name Stranglethorn Vale (Grom'gol)
@faction Horde
@levels 34-40
@zone Stranglethorn Vale
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Grom'gol Base Camp, Nesingwary's Expedition, the Bloodscalp and Skullsplitter trolls, and Booty Bay. A contested zone - watch for Alliance players.
@next H_Dustwallow

fp Grom'gol
bind Grom'gol
accept Mok'thardin's Enchantment | Far Seer Mok'thardin.
accept The Defense of Grom'gol | Commander Aggro'gosh.
accept Bloody Bone Necklaces | Kin'weelay.
accept Welcome to the Jungle | Barnil Stonepot, Nesingwary's Expedition.
turnin Welcome to the Jungle
accept 194 Raptor Mastery
accept 185 Tiger Mastery
accept 190 Panther Mastery
accept Hunt for Yenniku | Nimboya, Grom'gol.
complete Hunt for Yenniku | Bloodscalp trolls west of Grom'gol.
complete Bloody Bone Necklaces | Bloodscalp trolls.
complete The Defense of Grom'gol | Raptors around Grom'gol.
complete Mok'thardin's Enchantment | Shadowmaw Claw drops from Elder Shadowmaw Panther and Shadowmaw Panther. Pristine Tigress Fang drops from Stranglethorn Tigress.
complete 185 Tiger Mastery
complete 190 Panther Mastery
complete 194 Raptor Mastery
turnin Hunt for Yenniku
accept Headhunting
turnin The Defense of Grom'gol
accept 569 The Defense of Grom'gol
turnin Bloody Bone Necklaces
turnin 185 Tiger Mastery
accept 186 Tiger Mastery
turnin 190 Panther Mastery
accept 191 Panther Mastery
complete Headhunting | Shrunken Head drops from Bloodscalp Headhunter.
complete 569 The Defense of Grom'gol
complete 186 Tiger Mastery
complete 191 Panther Mastery
turnin 186 Tiger Mastery
turnin 191 Panther Mastery
turnin 194 Raptor Mastery
accept 195 Raptor Mastery
complete 195 Raptor Mastery
turnin 195 Raptor Mastery
turnin Headhunting
turnin 569 The Defense of Grom'gol
turnin Mok'thardin's Enchantment
fp Booty Bay
accept Singing Blue Shards | Crank Fizzlebub.
accept Scaring Shaky | "Sea Wolf" MacKinley.
accept Supply and Demand | Drizzlik, Booty Bay.
complete Supply and Demand | Large River Crocolisk Skin drops from River Crocolisk.
complete Singing Blue Shards | Singing Crystal Shard drops from Cold Eye Basilisk, Crystal Spine Basilisk and Stone Maw Basilisk and others.
complete Scaring Shaky | Mistvale Giblets drops from Elder Mistvale Gorilla.
turnin Supply and Demand
accept Some Assembly Required
turnin Singing Blue Shards
accept Venture Company Mining
complete Some Assembly Required | Snapjaw Crocolisk Skin drops from Snapjaw Crocolisk.
turnin Scaring Shaky
accept Return to MacKinley
turnin Return to MacKinley
complete Venture Company Mining | Singing Blue Crystal drops from Venture Co. Foreman, Venture Co. Strip Miner and Venture Co. Surveyor and others.
turnin Some Assembly Required
turnin Venture Company Mining
level 39
train
note Fly to Brackenwall Village in Dustwallow Marsh (via Orgrimmar and the zeppelin if you lack the path).
